r"C\s*0?[\s_^{}()]*(?:or|and|/)[\s_^{}()]*C\s*0?2" — "C0_or_C2": C, 0?, then "0" matched by 0?, then `[\s_^{}()]*` matches "_", then "or", then `[\s_^{}()]*` matches "_", then "C2" ✓.

